sieve-filter-v1
; The map of actions to animations (sieve-actions-v1, SPECIFICATIONS 12.0p's neighbour, core/include/sieve/actions.hpp)
; written as a filter: "sieve-actions-v1", then "action NAME SHA-256" or "action NAME none" for idle, walk,
; run, jump, take, read and wave, once each in that order, every line ending in a line feed. Its
; survivors are exactly the maps read_actions reads (tools/check_formats.py holds it to the reader).
; Written by tools/grammars.py (the grammar is there; this table is what it compiles to).

id        format-actions
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   ascii96
describe  One sieve-actions-v1 map exactly: an action's animation for each of the seven actions, in order (IDEAS 19.185, 19.186).

class     c0    @0                       ; \n
class     c1    @1                       ;  
class     c2    @14                      ; -
class     c3    @17 @19..@26 @67 @71     ; 023456789bf
